{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30004_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:450a935775bca1508ad4abfe59c5f5547a46a8c9b5cc431c1181f0cf92aa9f12",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150cf7004730a0d0640fb5937c5f5182649bcb49fdaa853651bbdca5af477d08",
      "text": "录音当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c84bef78db2cb8336a393a94af7f27fcf2358a7f74bb28c07bcfb03695c47733",
      "text": "“向着全新的世界出发吧！\n就算失败了，那也是变得更强大的机会！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9bc9d5ca366185dd364f913e5819c15df403dfe619c4e9c255e0431774cfa61",
      "text": "“无论是好是坏……\n都能看到与现在不一样的风景呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a5e265adc743d94a248a6e1d17bdfab95f597c66f966949a9e775cc0f788c1d",
      "text": "“光是这样，不就超级开心的嘛！\n想要蜕变成全新的自己，全靠你的勇气哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000041:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录音结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b60b25c734cd9ac03d62a691d4f42771fa1bbbfcddff1ba72c88e1297a3b636",
      "text": "呼……结束了。\n虽然很紧张，但能顺利结束真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd9ff72ade177f25bb96c83a7dffd9dbe8e7781bad3f5b0681aa284869aaa05d",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n两位表现得都非常出色！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9069c8f4444c42cc44d7aaa39e4f915b87cfede9b6b2f2466a2ae131186ff2dc",
      "text": "谢谢！配音练习什么的，\n多亏了享介考虑了那么多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:618ed43aeb1093c04c18a3f7592fe9e598a221b0abfc3def59cfd9984e58c147",
      "text": "也是多亏了●●●●●●●●●●监督的\n协助啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94b7a5997e18b38211188cef985f4a254b9f4643181d9b6634517c27dd7b6c4f",
      "text": "两位，今天辛苦了。\n演技非常饱含深情，非常棒哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58471f6287ce1966246f83ae4c9bc532c3912a1cc5a67419b83b6731db9492b0",
      "text": "我们才要感谢您！\n真的非常开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a60ba38e2496ad7bb4a64a65c70763e8165b115110c529cdfda06a8e567a3926",
      "text": "很期待正式播出的那天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2",
      "text": "辛苦各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
